WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:44.529
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:44.799 --> 01:45.599
Xiao Kai...

3
01:46.079 --> 01:47.879
How are things with Xinjie?

4
01:48.079 --> 01:49.760
Don't worry about Xinjie.

5
01:50.159 --> 01:50.840
I've already handled it.

6
01:52.200 --> 01:54.760
Then when are you coming to see me?

7
01:55.640 --> 01:58.640
I've been busy with work lately.

8
01:59.439 --> 02:00.280
I don't have time to visit.

9
02:01.000 --> 02:01.719
Always traveling for work.

10
02:01.959 --> 02:03.439
You're always busy, busy, busy.

11
02:04.319 --> 02:05.959
What kind of job is this anyway?

12
02:06.239 --> 02:08.000
Hanging around all day

13
02:08.000 --> 02:09.199
with shady characters.

14
02:10.360 --> 02:11.719
Have you been fighting lately?

15
02:12.080 --> 02:13.000
Are you hurt?

16
02:14.560 --> 02:15.919
I'm not hurt.

17
02:16.080 --> 02:17.319
Xiao Kai, I...

18
02:17.680 --> 02:19.240
Don't mind your mom's nagging.

19
02:19.719 --> 02:20.800
I'm getting old.

20
02:20.800 --> 02:22.960
I just want you to stay safe and healthy.

21
02:24.159 --> 02:25.680
Just don't let me be

22
02:25.680 --> 02:27.879
a parent burying their child.

23
02:33.120 --> 02:33.840
All right, I got it.

24
02:35.879 --> 02:36.800
I'm hanging up now.

25
03:57.840 --> 03:59.199
Ride-hailing real-name verification

26
03:59.360 --> 04:01.039
requires the user's phone number,

27
04:01.120 --> 04:03.280
ID, and bank card to belong to the same person.

28
04:03.439 --> 04:04.879
However, their verification system

29
04:05.039 --> 04:06.240
doesn't share data

30
04:06.360 --> 04:07.280
with the police database.

31
04:07.560 --> 04:09.159
So registering under someone else's identity

32
04:09.319 --> 04:10.000
is entirely possible.

33
04:10.639 --> 04:12.439
This user we found, Xiao Ran,

34
04:12.599 --> 04:13.680
was actually registered dead

35
04:13.840 --> 04:14.800
two months ago.

36
04:16.319 --> 04:17.360
Criminals nowadays sell

37
04:17.600 --> 04:19.360
complete sets of stolen personal data.

38
04:19.720 --> 04:22.240
More and more people steal identities

39
04:22.240 --> 04:23.319
to commit crimes.

40
04:23.920 --> 04:27.319
Did you look into the phone

41
04:27.319 --> 04:28.879
the suspect used to hail rides?

42
04:29.680 --> 04:31.839
Call records from the telecom company show

43
04:32.120 --> 04:33.160
that this phone number

44
04:33.319 --> 04:34.399
has no other call history.

45
04:34.720 --> 04:36.000
It was likely only used to hail rides.

46
04:36.759 --> 04:38.160
But since yesterday,

47
04:38.360 --> 04:40.399
the phone has been turned off.

48
04:41.079 --> 04:42.480
The document in front of you

49
04:42.759 --> 04:43.680
shows the designated destinations

50
04:43.680 --> 04:45.120
requested by this phone number

51
04:45.240 --> 04:47.439
since it registered for the service.

52
04:47.800 --> 04:49.279
If we check these locations,

53
04:49.639 --> 04:50.560
we can track down those

54
04:50.560 --> 04:52.120
who bought drugs from the suspect.

55
04:52.319 --> 04:53.319
Through these buyers,

56
04:53.600 --> 04:54.839
we can find the seller.

57
04:55.560 --> 04:56.560
I've already found the seller.

58
05:00.279 --> 05:02.000
The rich kid we caught yesterday said

59
05:02.360 --> 05:04.480
the seller reached out to him in a WeChat group.

60
05:04.759 --> 05:05.759
I tried joining all the WeChat groups

61
05:05.759 --> 05:06.759
that he was in.

62
05:07.040 --> 05:07.720
To my surprise,

63
05:08.000 --> 05:09.279
without me saying a single word,

64
05:09.519 --> 05:10.759
the suspect added me directly.

65
05:15.439 --> 05:16.360
"Misty Drizzle."

66
05:16.920 --> 05:17.560
A woman?

67
05:18.360 --> 05:20.480
Using a woman's photo doesn't make him one.

68
05:22.040 --> 05:23.839
Is there any way to hook him?

69
05:24.199 --> 05:25.240
I already did.

70
05:25.600 --> 05:26.920
He's asking for my delivery address.

71
05:27.759 --> 05:29.040
He said within two hours,

72
05:29.800 --> 05:31.480
the goods will be delivered to the designated spot.

73
05:32.199 --> 05:33.560
Delivered in just two hours?

74
05:33.920 --> 05:34.920
That's pretty brazen.

75
05:37.720 --> 05:38.439
Send it to Ding Tao.

76
05:38.680 --> 05:39.199
Take a look.

77
05:42.000 --> 05:42.560
Sent.

78
05:48.759 --> 05:50.800
But the deliveries are made by ride-hailing drivers.

79
05:51.040 --> 05:52.839
How do we catch the actual drug dealer?

80
05:53.120 --> 05:53.920
There's a way.

81
05:54.800 --> 05:56.360
Yesterday, the suspect handed off the drugs

82
05:56.360 --> 05:58.040
to the driver on Wudao Street.

83
05:58.519 --> 06:00.120
We can contact the ride-hailing company

84
06:00.120 --> 06:01.120
and have them cooperate with us.

85
06:01.279 --> 06:03.360
During our agreed time window,

86
06:03.560 --> 06:05.759
any driver who gets the order we set up

87
06:05.920 --> 06:07.480
will be replaced by one of our officers

88
06:07.600 --> 06:08.439
to meet the dealer.

89
06:09.879 --> 06:10.959
However, we're not sure yet

90
06:10.959 --> 06:13.079
if it's an individual or a syndicate.

91
06:14.079 --> 06:14.920
So I think

92
06:15.160 --> 06:16.920
we should split into at least two teams.

93
06:20.720 --> 06:21.199
He Bo,

94
06:21.560 --> 06:22.800
contact the ride-hailing company

95
06:22.959 --> 06:24.040
and coordinate their cooperation.

96
06:24.600 --> 06:25.079
Guan Qiang,

97
06:25.439 --> 06:26.720
disguise yourself as a ride-hailing driver.

98
06:27.040 --> 06:28.279
Li Xiao, pose as a passenger.

99
06:28.639 --> 06:29.560
Contact the drug dealer

100
06:29.720 --> 06:31.639
and set up a delivery time and location.

101
06:31.839 --> 06:33.519
Try to schedule the delivery

102
06:33.639 --> 06:35.319
between 2:00 and 4:00 p.m.

103
06:36.040 --> 06:36.519
Got it.

104
06:37.199 --> 06:37.720
Captain Lu,

105
06:38.680 --> 06:40.519
get the mobile unit ready to make the arrest.

106
06:40.879 --> 06:41.120
Understood.

107
06:41.439 --> 06:41.959
Captain Bai,

108
06:42.319 --> 06:44.000
then I'll have him deliver the goods before 4:00 p.m. today

109
06:44.079 --> 06:45.920
to Hongyi Primary School on Jingzhou Road.

110
06:45.920 --> 06:46.439
Sounds good.

111
06:57.120 --> 06:58.160
Xiaokang usually

112
06:58.480 --> 07:00.319
spends most of his time

113
07:00.319 --> 07:01.000
fooling around with his girlfriend.

114
07:01.199 --> 07:02.120
There's nothing suspicious about him.

115
07:03.959 --> 07:04.600
Where were you yesterday?

116
07:06.480 --> 07:07.199
The rehab center.

117
07:09.160 --> 07:10.279
A friend of mine does drugs

118
07:10.560 --> 07:11.879
and got sent there for rehab.

119
07:12.040 --> 07:12.920
I went to check on him.

120
07:18.959 --> 07:20.480
We have a mole among us,

121
07:20.639 --> 07:21.759
and you've got time for that?

122
07:22.519 --> 07:24.480
I've tailed Xiaokang for days.

123
07:24.600 --> 07:26.079
I really don't think he's dirty.

124
07:29.720 --> 07:31.079
Were you on him 24 hours a day?

125
07:31.560 --> 07:34.639
How can you be so sure he's clean?

126
07:36.759 --> 07:37.959
We're all brothers here.

127
07:38.759 --> 07:40.360
There's no need to be so suspicious.

128
07:43.120 --> 07:44.720
It's not about whether it's necessary.

129
07:45.600 --> 07:47.160
It's the rule in our line of work.

130
07:48.120 --> 07:50.120
Caution matters more than loyalty.

131
07:54.720 --> 07:55.680
Let me show you something.

132
08:10.480 --> 08:11.959
Something felt off to me lately,

133
08:13.560 --> 08:14.959
so I installed a camera here.

134
08:16.120 --> 08:17.959
Look, this was recorded remotely on my phone.

135
08:21.240 --> 08:21.839
Take a look.

136
08:22.839 --> 08:24.759
This is that "brother" of yours.

137
08:27.639 --> 08:28.680
But just based on this,

138
08:29.519 --> 08:30.360
we still cant be certain

139
08:30.360 --> 08:31.839
that Xiaokang is an undercover cop.

140
08:42.000 --> 08:43.159
It was found in my car.

141
08:53.879 --> 08:54.679
Xiaokang did it.

142
08:55.639 --> 08:56.279
What do you think?

143
08:58.240 --> 09:00.759
Ever since that kid got out of prison,

144
09:01.240 --> 09:02.840
I bet he turned into a police informant.

145
09:05.440 --> 09:06.919
I kept wondering

146
09:06.919 --> 09:09.519
why the cops have been tailing me lately.

147
09:12.600 --> 09:13.120
So,

148
09:15.559 --> 09:16.759
what should we do now?

149
09:23.080 --> 09:25.600
Xiaokang hasn't been with me long.

150
09:26.559 --> 09:28.679
He couldn't have gotten much evidence on me.

151
09:30.720 --> 09:31.320
Kai,

152
09:33.120 --> 09:35.679
can you stage an accident for me?

153
09:43.519 --> 09:44.159
Make it clean.

154
09:46.679 --> 09:47.440
One more thing.

155
09:56.799 --> 09:57.440
Grab a couple of guys

156
09:58.679 --> 10:00.159
and collect a debt for me at this place.

157
10:06.440 --> 10:07.480
Remember to take Xiaokang along.

158
10:08.200 --> 10:09.159
Don't let him catch on.

159
10:25.200 --> 10:26.159
South Gate of No. 137.

160
10:26.519 --> 10:28.039
Carpool to Hongfeng Garden Phase One.

161
10:28.399 --> 10:31.840
The ride-hail plate is Nan AN10H1.

162
10:31.840 --> 10:32.799
The driver's name is Cai Zhen.

163
10:36.480 --> 10:37.720
Got it.

164
10:39.240 --> 10:39.679
Captain Bai.

165
10:40.000 --> 10:40.879
We checked this number.

166
10:41.120 --> 10:42.559
Aside from regular ride-hailing,

167
10:42.799 --> 10:44.120
there are no other call records.

168
10:46.120 --> 10:47.519
It matches our suspect completely.

169
10:50.919 --> 10:51.879
Track the car owner's phone.

170
10:52.080 --> 10:54.000
Sync the car's location to Captain Lu.

171
11:14.159 --> 11:15.000
The silver Accord

172
11:15.200 --> 11:16.120
is just up ahead.

173
11:16.720 --> 11:18.120
Let's catch up and cut them off.

174
11:25.559 --> 11:26.039
Hey guys,

175
11:26.559 --> 11:28.519
has Brother Biao's business gotten bigger lately?

176
11:28.679 --> 11:29.519
He's collecting cash everywhere.

177
11:30.840 --> 11:32.639
That's just chump change.

178
11:32.919 --> 11:33.720
Brother Biao said

179
11:34.440 --> 11:36.440
he's going to squeeze Li Qiang for a huge score.

180
11:37.759 --> 11:39.240
Then we should tell Brother Biao

181
11:39.519 --> 11:40.919
to give us a raise.

182
11:41.679 --> 11:42.799
In your dreams.

183
11:43.840 --> 11:45.799
Brother Biao is too stingy.

184
11:46.440 --> 11:47.759
He took us out for seafood the other day,

185
11:47.960 --> 11:49.120
and wouldn't even order shark fin.

186
11:49.320 --> 11:50.879
And you expect him to give us a raise?

187
11:51.519 --> 11:52.440
Ge Dana,

188
11:53.399 --> 11:55.759
badmouthing Brother Biao behind his back?

189
11:56.519 --> 11:57.879
Brother Biao always rewards merit.

190
11:58.279 --> 11:59.679
As long as we do our jobs well,

191
11:59.960 --> 12:00.840
money won't be a problem.

192
12:02.519 --> 12:03.200
That's true.

193
12:04.840 --> 12:06.440
Still, Brother Kai,

194
12:08.840 --> 12:11.399
you're Brother Biao's favorite right now.

195
12:11.919 --> 12:14.159
If he gives you any assignments,

196
12:14.720 --> 12:16.399
don't forget about us boys.

197
12:17.720 --> 12:19.360
Whomever Brother Biao assigns,

198
12:19.480 --> 12:20.639
he has his reasons.

199
12:21.200 --> 12:22.720
If we're not meant to be involved,

200
12:22.919 --> 12:23.720
we'd better stay out of it.

201
12:24.960 --> 12:26.960
No way, we still have to ask Brother Biao

202
12:26.960 --> 12:27.919
for a raise.

203
12:29.039 --> 12:30.919
I want to buy a house and get married this year.

204
13:00.320 --> 13:01.720
Wh-what's going on?

205
13:20.919 --> 13:21.480
Who are you looking for?

206
13:22.399 --> 13:23.200
AC repair.

207
13:24.080 --> 13:25.559
Isn't your AC broken?

208
13:26.519 --> 13:27.120
Come on in.

209
13:49.919 --> 13:50.279
This way.

210
14:10.159 --> 14:11.919
That guy in orange is him.

211
14:18.840 --> 14:19.759
Are you the ride-share driver?

212
14:20.960 --> 14:22.840
Did you book a ride to Hongfeng Estate?

213
14:23.799 --> 14:25.200
Yeah, yeah. Are you here?

214
14:25.240 --> 14:25.840
I'm here.

215
14:28.639 --> 14:29.559
I see you.

216
14:29.759 --> 14:30.399
I'm heading over now.

217
14:47.480 --> 14:48.200
I don't need a ride.

218
14:48.399 --> 14:49.440
Could you deliver something for me?

219
14:49.919 --> 14:51.080
Call the number on this when you get there.

220
14:51.240 --> 14:51.799
Someone will pick it up.

221
14:52.440 --> 14:52.960
Thanks.

222
14:53.600 --> 14:54.120
Sure thing.

223
15:08.679 --> 15:09.120
Move in!

224
15:13.600 --> 15:14.200
Where are they?

225
15:14.440 --> 15:14.960
In the back.

226
15:32.279 --> 15:33.120
Where's your hideout?

227
15:34.320 --> 15:35.120
Right in that building.

228
15:35.559 --> 15:36.000
Upstairs.

229
15:37.320 --> 15:37.840
How many of them?

230
15:38.679 --> 15:39.519
There were five at first.

231
15:40.240 --> 15:41.200
Then three more came.

232
15:41.399 --> 15:41.960
I don't know them.

233
15:44.320 --> 15:45.039
Notify the detectives.

234
15:47.039 --> 15:47.679
Take us up.

235
15:48.279 --> 15:48.840
Okay.

236
15:58.639 --> 16:00.440
So you'll be collecting the money from now on?

237
16:01.840 --> 16:02.879
I wouldn't know about that.

238
16:05.960 --> 16:06.919
Where's that punk Hu Dong?

239
16:07.399 --> 16:07.960
He skipped town.

240
16:08.639 --> 16:09.759
Who? Hu Dong?

241
16:13.360 --> 16:14.759
Looks like you're just following orders, too.

242
16:15.120 --> 16:15.759
All right, then.

243
16:41.120 --> 16:41.600
Freeze!

244
16:41.840 --> 16:43.120
Freeze! Don't move!

245
16:43.559 --> 16:44.039
Don't move!

246
16:44.320 --> 16:44.919
Stop!

247
16:48.440 --> 16:49.840
Stop right there!

248
16:53.240 --> 16:53.840
Come with me!

249
17:00.799 --> 17:01.360
Don't move!

250
17:13.559 --> 17:14.119
Cuff him.

251
17:35.519 --> 17:36.079
Split up!

252
17:47.640 --> 17:48.559
Captain, look at this.

253
18:20.079 --> 18:21.240
Ding Tao, zoom in on image three.

254
18:21.279 --> 18:21.559
Got it.

255
19:17.960 --> 19:19.759
Xiao Cui, take your men and fall back right now!

256
19:19.920 --> 19:20.480
Fall back!

257
19:46.119 --> 19:47.279
I have a feeling that today,

258
19:47.799 --> 19:49.279
we're gonna die right here.

259
20:40.960 --> 20:41.880
Screw you.

260
20:45.640 --> 20:46.680
Shoot me.

261
20:59.200 --> 21:00.279
Li Xiao, are you all right?

262
21:00.319 --> 21:00.920
I'll leave this to you.

263
21:00.960 --> 21:01.279
All right.

264
21:07.640 --> 21:08.440
I'll wait for you at the old house.

265
21:21.200 --> 21:22.119
Put your hands up!

266
21:26.599 --> 21:27.640
This Li Xiao...

267
22:00.880 --> 22:01.519
Stop!

268
22:06.519 --> 22:07.160
Drop your gun.

269
22:09.799 --> 22:10.680
What's the situation?

270
22:11.039 --> 22:12.000
I didn't want to blow my cover.

271
22:12.400 --> 22:13.279
He was in danger just now.

272
22:13.799 --> 22:14.799
You fired that shot.

273
22:22.720 --> 22:23.359
Let me introduce you.

274
22:24.279 --> 22:26.079
Undercover officer, Wei Kai.

275
22:27.920 --> 22:28.720
Li Xiao.

276
22:30.000 --> 22:30.480
Wei Kai.

277
22:32.200 --> 22:32.680
Li Xiao.

278
22:33.160 --> 22:34.039
Nice moves.

279
22:34.319 --> 22:34.880
You too.

280
22:35.240 --> 22:35.839
About earlier...

281
22:36.599 --> 22:37.119
Thanks.

282
22:46.880 --> 22:48.119
Why didn't you give us a heads-up?

283
22:48.960 --> 22:50.839
It happened so fast, there was no time.

284
22:52.440 --> 22:53.759
Something's wrong with the tracker.

285
22:54.240 --> 22:55.480
Did Liang Wenbiao find it?

286
22:56.039 --> 22:57.359
He's been getting more cautious lately.

287
23:01.799 --> 23:02.440
Are you compromised?

288
23:05.319 --> 23:05.960
I'm not sure.

289
23:10.559 --> 23:11.960
I won't know until I see Liang Wenbiao.

290
23:13.359 --> 23:14.640
If you can't be sure,

291
23:15.279 --> 23:16.559
I won't let you go back.

292
23:19.599 --> 23:22.119
Li Qiang contacted Liang Wenbiao again recently.

293
23:22.920 --> 23:24.799
I think they'll make the deal in a few days.

294
23:25.319 --> 23:26.680
We've followed this lead for so long.

295
23:27.240 --> 23:28.279
I don't want to give up now.

296
23:28.599 --> 23:29.680
Your safety comes first.

297
23:32.319 --> 23:34.279
Judging by the situation,

298
23:34.680 --> 23:37.480
Liang Wenbiao probably suspects Chen Kang.

299
23:37.880 --> 23:39.359
I should be safe for now.

300
23:43.440 --> 23:44.400
I'll get off up ahead.

301
23:57.880 --> 23:58.759
Hold on.

302
24:06.599 --> 24:07.200
A tracker.

303
24:08.160 --> 24:09.160
Your birthday's in a few days.

304
24:14.759 --> 24:15.079
This...

305
24:15.559 --> 24:16.519
This must be pretty expensive.

306
24:16.960 --> 24:17.799
It didn't cost much.

307
24:18.359 --> 24:19.079
Just play around with it.

308
24:23.680 --> 24:24.200
Thanks, Boss.

309
24:26.880 --> 24:27.359
Wei Kai.

310
24:28.359 --> 24:29.799
Remember what I told you.

311
24:31.240 --> 24:31.920
Stay alive.

312
25:04.200 --> 25:04.880
Let me make a call first.

313
25:13.960 --> 25:14.319
What is it?

314
25:16.079 --> 25:17.160
The drugs from this trafficking ring

315
25:17.160 --> 25:18.279
originated from the Chaoqing online store.

316
25:18.440 --> 25:19.880
If our guess is right,

317
25:20.039 --> 25:21.960
Yike Gifts is tied to this as well.

318
25:22.799 --> 25:23.400
Got it.

319
25:24.759 --> 25:26.880
You've seemed a bit off lately.

320
25:27.039 --> 25:27.880
Why don't you take a few days off?

321
25:29.319 --> 25:30.480
I don't need to rest, Captain Bai.

322
25:32.880 --> 25:34.359
But I'd like to request some time off.

323
25:34.920 --> 25:35.799
Just half a day.

324
25:36.000 --> 25:36.400
All right.

325
25:54.759 --> 25:55.440
Is Tian Xin here?

326
25:55.640 --> 25:57.400
Tian Xin hasn't come in for two days.

327
26:01.480 --> 26:02.200
If she shows up,

328
26:02.200 --> 26:03.319
let me know right away.

329
26:04.079 --> 26:04.480
Okay.

330
26:04.920 --> 26:05.480
Thanks.

331
26:06.000 --> 26:06.559
You're welcome.

332
26:16.519 --> 26:17.240
Tian Xin!

333
26:20.079 --> 26:20.759
Tian Xin!

334
26:26.200 --> 26:26.960
Tian Xin!

335
27:00.279 --> 27:01.759
Why didn't you just kill me?

336
27:12.440 --> 27:13.559
Is that what you really think?

337
27:16.200 --> 27:17.480
What are you really trying to do?

338
27:31.519 --> 27:32.720
Do you love him?

339
27:34.680 --> 27:36.279
I asked if you love him!

340
27:39.279 --> 27:39.920
You won't answer?

341
27:42.000 --> 27:43.920
Then I'll take my men to ask your boyfriend.

342
27:44.559 --> 27:46.240
What the hell do you want?

343
27:46.279 --> 27:47.839
I asked if you love him!

344
27:47.839 --> 27:48.400
Yes!

345
27:53.279 --> 27:53.880
I love him.

346
27:56.400 --> 27:57.680
I... Yes, I love him!

347
28:06.480 --> 28:08.319
Then you'd better pray.

348
28:18.160 --> 28:19.440
Maybe I'll grant your wish.

349
28:22.720 --> 28:23.359
No!

350
28:23.519 --> 28:24.640
Don't!

351
28:26.519 --> 28:27.480
Come back!

352
28:27.799 --> 28:28.759
No!

353
28:30.440 --> 28:31.440
Please don't!

354
28:36.160 --> 28:37.559
I only sent you to pick up cash,

355
28:37.559 --> 28:38.640
and you caused such a huge mess!

356
28:39.319 --> 28:39.839
Brother Biao...

357
28:40.519 --> 28:41.720
This had nothing to do with us.

358
28:42.759 --> 28:44.079
The cops were going after that kid, Zhao Jianfeng,

359
28:44.279 --> 28:45.279
and we just happened to run into them!

360
28:46.559 --> 28:47.599
If it weren't for Brother Kai today,

361
28:48.000 --> 28:49.119
the two of us would've gone down too.

362
28:50.640 --> 28:51.599
You two made it back,

363
28:52.279 --> 28:52.960
but where's Kai?

364
28:53.640 --> 28:54.880
If the cops caught him,

365
28:54.880 --> 28:56.200
we'd all be completely exposed!

366
28:58.279 --> 28:58.799
Brother Kai!

367
29:02.960 --> 29:03.480
Brother Biao.

368
29:05.119 --> 29:05.759
Are you all right?

369
29:05.799 --> 29:07.279
I almost didn't make it out.

370
29:07.920 --> 29:09.720
Where's Xiaokang? He didn't come back?

371
29:10.519 --> 29:11.799
Like he'd dare come back!

372
29:12.119 --> 29:13.519
If I get my hands on that bastard,

373
29:13.680 --> 29:15.160
I swear I'll kill him!

374
29:16.720 --> 29:18.319
I knew something was off with him.

375
29:21.079 --> 29:22.240
You two go track him down right now.

376
29:22.480 --> 29:23.559
Go, right now!

377
29:24.599 --> 29:25.079
Right away, Boss.

378
29:31.160 --> 29:32.240
As for what I told you to do,

379
29:32.240 --> 29:34.119
get on it immediately.

380
29:47.400 --> 29:48.799
Miss Gu, what advice do you have for me?

381
29:50.119 --> 29:52.480
Between Weiyuan International Trade and your Runze Commerce,

382
29:52.640 --> 29:53.839
there have been massive financial transactions,

383
29:54.079 --> 29:55.759
but the transaction details in these account books

384
29:55.839 --> 29:57.039
make no sense at all.

385
29:59.200 --> 29:59.720
Miss Gu,

386
30:00.759 --> 30:02.319
I don't follow what you're saying.

387
30:03.160 --> 30:03.920
Runze Commerce

388
30:04.000 --> 30:06.079
is a subsidiary of Longze Group.

389
30:06.599 --> 30:08.279
How did it become my personal company?

390
30:10.839 --> 30:12.160
In Runze Commerce, you hold

391
30:12.279 --> 30:13.519
a 70 percent stake.

392
30:14.279 --> 30:16.599
Longze Group holds 30 percent on paper,

393
30:17.440 --> 30:18.880
but when it comes to Runze Commerce's profits,

394
30:18.880 --> 30:20.480
the group has never actually shared in them.

395
30:21.079 --> 30:22.000
Especially over the past two years,

396
30:22.359 --> 30:23.720
it hasn't received any dividends.

397
30:24.599 --> 30:26.039
I really can't understand

398
30:26.240 --> 30:27.640
why all those payments from Runze Commerce

399
30:27.839 --> 30:29.839
to Weiyuan International

400
30:30.160 --> 30:31.240
had to be routed through so many

401
30:31.319 --> 30:32.640
of Longze Group's subsidiaries.

402
30:35.200 --> 30:36.960
I've been with Longze Group for so many years,

403
30:38.039 --> 30:39.440
and the board of directors has never once

404
30:39.440 --> 30:40.559
questioned my accounts.

405
30:44.720 --> 30:45.839
If there's anything you're unclear about,

406
30:46.359 --> 30:47.640
you can ask President Jiang directly.

407
30:48.359 --> 30:50.039
President Jiang was the one who sent me to ask you.

408
30:53.880 --> 30:54.519
Miss Gu,

409
30:55.160 --> 30:56.559
I know you returned from abroad.

410
30:57.279 --> 30:58.400
You might think

411
30:58.680 --> 31:00.759
things here work just like in Europe.

412
31:01.759 --> 31:03.039
Since you're new here,

413
31:03.359 --> 31:04.160
even though you're targeting me,

414
31:04.480 --> 31:05.440
I won't hold it against you.

415
31:05.960 --> 31:06.880
But let me remind you,

416
31:07.759 --> 31:09.279
when you arrive at a new place,

417
31:09.960 --> 31:12.839
you'd better adapt to your new surroundings first.

418
31:14.279 --> 31:15.279
In this company,

419
31:16.640 --> 31:18.480
every department has its own rules

420
31:18.480 --> 31:19.319
and unspoken rules.

421
31:20.759 --> 31:22.559
Before you understand the rules,

422
31:23.359 --> 31:24.920
you'd better not act so recklessly.

423
31:26.640 --> 31:28.400
I don't really follow what you're saying.

424
31:29.400 --> 31:31.519
The company hired me to do my job.

425
31:31.799 --> 31:33.000
I'm not targeting anyone.

426
31:34.039 --> 31:35.559
But whatever the company assigns me,

427
31:35.680 --> 31:36.720
I will make sure it's done right.

428
31:38.000 --> 31:39.440
If anyone's actions

429
31:39.559 --> 31:40.640
harm this company,

430
31:42.319 --> 31:43.720
I will investigate to the very end.

431
31:43.880 --> 31:44.960
Then take your time investigating.

432
31:57.920 --> 31:59.079
But let me warn you,

433
31:59.400 --> 32:00.440
in whatever you do,

434
32:01.160 --> 32:02.559
always leave yourself a way out.

435
32:03.160 --> 32:04.920
Don't act rashly and hit a brick wall,

436
32:05.559 --> 32:06.759
where there's no turning back

437
32:07.960 --> 32:09.440
and you end up crushed to pieces.

438
32:27.519 --> 32:28.759
Things have been too hot lately,

439
32:29.359 --> 32:31.240
so I didn't get you involved in much.

440
32:32.559 --> 32:34.640
But our situation is getting worse.

441
32:37.880 --> 32:39.880
The boss stopped us from collecting debts recently.

442
32:40.359 --> 32:41.960
Does he not trust us anymore?

443
32:42.160 --> 32:43.200
It's not that simple.

444
32:43.759 --> 32:45.039
Four-Legged Snake showing up

445
32:46.079 --> 32:48.400
seems to be about more than just replacing Mr. Ma.

446
32:50.000 --> 32:52.200
Didn't they say everything would be fine once Qian Feng was handled?

447
32:53.119 --> 32:54.480
That was the plan.

448
32:55.160 --> 32:56.079
But who would've thought

449
32:56.079 --> 32:57.759
the guys that idiot Four-Legged Snake sent

450
32:58.000 --> 32:59.599
would all get busted by the police?

451
33:00.559 --> 33:03.279
Qian Feng might've already told the police everything.

452
33:04.759 --> 33:06.880
The police have never come to check on Longze Group.

453
33:07.920 --> 33:09.599
Could you be overthinking this, Mr. Chen?

454
33:11.240 --> 33:12.640
I hope so.

455
33:12.920 --> 33:14.759
There's just too much going on lately.

456
33:16.200 --> 33:17.160
Qian Feng got arrested,

457
33:17.720 --> 33:19.720
and a new CFO was transferred to the company.

458
33:20.920 --> 33:22.559
Even Mr. Jiang can't handle her.

459
33:24.319 --> 33:25.960
We have so much money

460
33:26.440 --> 33:28.319
that used to be laundered through Longze Group.

461
33:29.880 --> 33:31.480
If Gu Xiaoyi keeps digging like this,

462
33:32.119 --> 33:33.680
I'm afraid what we did

463
33:34.279 --> 33:35.680
won't stay hidden for long.

464
33:36.319 --> 33:38.400
I don't quite get what you mean, Mr. Chen.

465
33:40.200 --> 33:41.720
Do you want me to

466
33:41.920 --> 33:43.759
make this Gu Xiaoyi disappear?

467
33:48.200 --> 33:49.079
Not just yet.

468
33:50.640 --> 33:53.079
Though I think it's time to give her a warning.

469
33:53.319 --> 33:54.000
Understood.

470
34:00.839 --> 34:03.519
It hasn't rained in Nanhai for a long time.

471
34:05.680 --> 34:08.320
When I was a kid, my grandma used to tell me

472
34:08.840 --> 34:10.840
that if it hasn't rained for a long time,

473
34:12.639 --> 34:14.559
you must remember to bring an umbrella when going out.

474
34:22.840 --> 34:23.880
When Mr. Ma left,

475
34:23.880 --> 34:25.280
he said he'd be back in a while.

476
34:25.599 --> 34:27.800
Why haven't we heard anything from him yet?

477
34:29.079 --> 34:29.960
He won't be coming back.

478
34:33.159 --> 34:35.159
I don't think anyone can save him now.

479
34:52.079 --> 34:52.639
Let's go.

480
35:10.199 --> 35:11.559
Wasn't it supposed to be tomorrow?

481
35:11.800 --> 35:13.559
Why make a move today all of a sudden?

482
35:14.440 --> 35:16.719
Word is the cops have an operation tomorrow.

483
35:16.719 --> 35:18.679
I suspect our cover's blown.

484
35:42.760 --> 35:43.239
Wait here.

485
36:16.320 --> 36:16.880
Cheers.

486
36:23.480 --> 36:25.239
Hurry up! Pack it up quickly.

487
36:25.239 --> 36:25.800
Got it.

488
36:33.199 --> 36:33.679
Who's there?

489
36:42.239 --> 36:43.639
We're here to pick up the goods for Mr. Chen.

490
36:43.920 --> 36:45.840
Weren't you supposed to pick it up this afternoon?

491
36:46.559 --> 36:48.039
Mr. Chen needs to ship the goods right away.

492
36:48.039 --> 36:49.800
So please cooperate with us.

493
36:50.639 --> 36:51.159
Abu.

494
36:58.079 --> 36:59.679
Are you really Mr. Chen's men?

495
37:00.920 --> 37:02.039
How come I've never seen you before?

496
37:45.159 --> 37:47.159
Tony, I missed you.

497
37:47.280 --> 37:48.519
I missed you too.

498
37:49.400 --> 37:50.320
Where's my money?

499
37:51.800 --> 37:53.360
Money, money... Where's my money?

500
37:53.840 --> 37:55.239
Money, money, money. Fine, money.

501
37:55.320 --> 37:56.800
Money, money.

502
37:59.119 --> 37:59.840
Money.

503
38:02.760 --> 38:03.239
Money.

504
38:04.840 --> 38:05.639
Where is my money?

505
38:06.599 --> 38:07.360
Money.

506
38:10.360 --> 38:11.119
Scram right now,

507
38:11.519 --> 38:12.360
and you might make it out alive.

508
39:34.079 --> 39:34.519
Zhuang!

509
39:36.199 --> 39:36.840
Zhuang!

510
39:40.599 --> 39:41.079
Zhuang!

511
39:45.079 --> 39:45.920
Zhuang, where are you?

512
39:48.800 --> 39:49.280
Zhuang!

513
40:03.360 --> 40:03.800
Let's go.

514
40:07.559 --> 40:08.000
Zhuang,

515
40:08.960 --> 40:09.519
are you okay?

516
40:31.840 --> 40:33.400
Police! The police are here!

517
40:33.400 --> 40:34.119
Police!

518
40:49.639 --> 40:50.400
Excuse me, everyone.

519
40:50.559 --> 40:51.519
We got a tip.

520
40:51.599 --> 40:53.119
They moved their operation up to today.

521
40:53.360 --> 40:53.920
Today?

522
40:54.079 --> 40:54.360
Yes.

523
40:54.559 --> 40:56.159
But we're not ready yet.

524
40:56.360 --> 40:58.719
Moving today is too dangerous.

525
40:58.960 --> 41:00.039
It's sudden,

526
41:00.039 --> 41:01.400
so please activate the backup plan right away.

527
41:01.400 --> 41:02.199
Please help us.

528
41:02.199 --> 41:02.719
Chief!

529
41:07.440 --> 41:10.679
A shootout broke out at No. 39 Zhouliu Pedestrian Street.

530
41:10.679 --> 41:13.679
Nearby patrols are heading there now.

531
41:16.840 --> 41:17.280
Let's go.

532
41:21.199 --> 41:22.079
Move, now!

533
41:34.000 --> 41:34.440
Let's go.

534
41:48.239 --> 41:48.559
Tony!

535
41:49.599 --> 41:49.920
Come back!

536
41:50.159 --> 41:50.800
Go!

537
41:50.800 --> 41:51.320
Come back!

538
42:15.920 --> 42:17.239
Thirty-five minutes ago,

539
42:17.239 --> 42:19.320
at No. 39 Zhouliu Pedestrian Street,

540
42:19.320 --> 42:21.599
a shooting occurred.

541
42:21.760 --> 42:23.920
Police neutralized several suspects at the scene.

542
42:24.079 --> 42:27.320
We still don't know the situation inside,

543
42:27.440 --> 42:29.639
but reportedly, inside the warehouse,

544
42:29.639 --> 42:32.119
there are still two gunmen.

545
42:32.480 --> 42:35.039
The commanding officer at the scene declared

546
42:35.159 --> 42:37.280
that if the suspects resist,

547
42:37.280 --> 42:40.000
they will be shot on sight.

548
42:48.039 --> 42:50.119
Into the room where the shooting occurred,

549
42:50.119 --> 42:52.320
police have just deployed tear gas.

550
43:08.039 --> 43:10.760
We can see over a dozen police officers

551
43:10.760 --> 43:13.159
storming inside armed with heavy weapons.

552
43:13.400 --> 43:15.199
We believe these criminals

553
43:15.199 --> 43:16.920
will surely all be rounded up.
